        <div type="layout" source="#source-35654-35805" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-35701-35763"><seg source="#source-35701-35763">二月二十一日　発行所例会。丸ビル集会室。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-35847-35903"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35847-35862"><rb>雛</rb><rt>ひな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35862-35892">の顔鼻無きがごとつる</seg><choice source="#source-35892-35898"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-35898-35903">と</seg></p>
