        <div type="layout" source="#source-36515-36654" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-36562-36612"><seg source="#source-36562-36612">三月八日　大崎会。丸ビル集会室。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-36696-36740"><seg source="#source-36696-36740">雨晴れておほどかなるや春の空</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-36740-36934" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
        <div type="layout" source="#source-36775-36896" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-36822-36854"><seg source="#source-36822-36854">三月十四日　謡句会。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-36938-37000"><seg source="#source-36938-36953">たとふれば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36953-36971"><rb>独楽</rb><rt>こま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36971-37000">のはぢける如くなり</seg></p>
