        <div type="layout" source="#source-37376-37530" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-37423-37488"><seg source="#source-37423-37488">四月二日　家庭俳句会。葉山、平、畠山別邸。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
