        <p source="#source-38232-38288"><seg source="#source-38232-38262">畦塗るや首をかしげて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38262-38283"><rb>懇</rb><rt>ねんごろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38283-38288">に</seg></p>
