        <div type="layout" source="#source-38323-38465" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-38370-38423"><seg source="#source-38370-38423">四月十二日　大崎会。丸ビル集会室。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-38507-38551"><seg source="#source-38507-38513">さま</seg><choice source="#source-38513-38522"><orig>／″＼</orig><reg>〲</reg></choice><seg source="#source-38522-38551">の情のもつれ暮の春</seg></p>
