      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-39069-39131"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-39069-39093"><rb>熊蜂</rb><rt>くまばち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-39093-39131">のうなり飛び去る棒のごと</seg></p>
