      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-39991-40050"><seg source="#source-39991-40003">麦の穂の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40003-40024"><rb>出揃</rb><rt>でそろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40024-40039">ふ頃のすが</seg><choice source="#source-40039-40045"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-40045-40050">し</seg></p>
