          <p source="#source-65458-65559"><seg source="#source-65458-65494">四月三日　武蔵野探勝会。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-65494-65518"><rb>神代</rb><rt>じんだい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-65518-65524">村、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-65524-65554"><rb>深大寺</rb><rt>じんだいじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-65554-65559">。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-65643-65723"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-65643-65655"><rb>彼</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-65655-65661">の女</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-65661-65685"><rb>春日</rb><rt>はるひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-65685-65697">まぶしく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-65697-65715"><rb>瞬</rb><rt>またた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-65715-65723">けり</seg></p>
