        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-69840-69905"><seg source="#source-69840-69849">欄干に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69849-69873"><rb>江山</rb><rt>こうざん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-69873-69879">低し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69879-69894"><rb>蚤</rb><rt>のみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-69894-69905">ふるふ</seg></p>
