        <p source="#source-70378-70452"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-70378-70402"><rb>我思</rb><rt>わがおも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-70402-70414">ふまゝに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-70414-70438"><rb>孑孑</rb><rt>ぼうふら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-70438-70452">うき沈み</seg></p>
