      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-132569-132649"><seg source="#source-132569-132578">営々と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-132578-132593"><rb>蠅</rb><rt>はえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-132593-132596">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-132596-132608"><rb>捕</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-132608-132617">りをり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-132617-132647"><rb>蠅捕器</rb><rt>はえとりき</rt></ruby></p>
