          <p source="#source-133027-133080"><seg source="#source-133027-133080">六月二十七日　丸之内倶楽部俳句会。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-133164-133226"><seg source="#source-133164-133179">松の雨つい</seg><choice source="#source-133179-133185"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-133185-133194">と吸ひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-133194-133224"><rb>蟻地獄</rb><rt>ありじごく</rt></ruby></p>
