      <div type="layout" source="#source-133226-133471" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
        <div type="layout" source="#source-133261-133433" rend="font-size small(1)">
          <p source="#source-133308-133391"><seg source="#source-133308-133353">六月二十九日　鎌倉俳句会。藤沢</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-133353-133386"><rb>遊行寺</rb><rt>ゆぎょうじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-133386-133391">。</seg></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-133475-133545"><seg source="#source-133475-133487">父老健に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-133487-133505"><rb>喜雨</rb><rt>きう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-133505-133508">又</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-133508-133526"><rb>到</rb><rt>いた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-133526-133545">る安んぜよ</seg></p>
